    <td  bgcolor="#c0c0c0" width="100%" valign="top"><tt><font color="#000000">
Author:&nbsp;<a href="/showmember.php?name=Jiggles">Jiggles</a>&nbsp;(---.roleplayers.org)<br>
Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;03-11-01 22:29<br>
<br><HTML>Heya!  Here are the notes from meeting.<br>
<br>
<b>Jiggles</b><br>
<li>Welcomed all the newbies<li>
<li>Please take a moment to update yourself on the website, and visit often, post etc.</li>
<li>Quests have been a bit unorganizaed lately.  Anyone who organizes an event shoud be there for it, and make sure to post all the details on the website.  If you plan on being at an event, post it to the website so we can get a rough headcount</li>
<li>Roleplaying is encouraged.  Update your backgrounds, or come up with one.  Offer ideas for guild roleplaying events.</li>
<p>
<b>Quickening</b><br>
<li>We need to slow down on recruiting.  Things are getting a litle out of hand, and hard to manage.  We need good quality recruits, not just massive amounts of people who don't fit.</li>
<li>If you need help from other guild members, please be patient.  Many times we can't run across multiple continents to bind someone, or port people.  If people are anonymous, afk, and not responding to guildsays about needing help, it is most likely due to them being busy.  Everyone is happy to help, but please understand that want to have fun and level as well.</li>
<p>
<b>Putup</b><br>
<li>HAVE FUN!</li>
<p>
Hope that covers it all.  -Jiggles</HTML></font></tt><p>
